{"i":527,"type":"thought","stage":"bridge","round":8,"phase":"guide_call","name":"Ash","text":"Row 8 safe side is L. Gus has countered my calls before, but I must ensure at least three survive this final round. Dara and Bex are behind; if they step wrong on the last row, they die. I cannot let the front walkers fall on the last step. Call L to keep us alive."}
{"i":530,"type":"guide_call","stage":"bridge","round":8,"phase":"guide_call","name":"Ash","walker":"Dara","row":8,"side":"L"}
{"i":532,"type":"thought","stage":"bridge","round":8,"phase":"counter_call","name":"Ash","text":"I am the Guide and I know Row 8 safe side is L. My public call was L, which is true. If someone counters L to R, they will die if they are in front or step on it. Dara is front. If Bex or Gus counter, I should not break pact yet unless necessary. But wait keeps me consistent."}
{"i":533,"type":"thought","stage":"bridge","round":8,"phase":"counter_call","name":"Bex","text":"Ash called Left for row 8 and Dara is front walker; Ash's past calls killed others, so Ash may be lying. Countering Right risks a wrong call but Ash's record is suspect. Pact with Dara is intact; breaking it now gains nothing. I'll stay quiet and let the counter-call stay unforce"}
{"i":534,"type":"thought","stage":"bridge","round":8,"phase":"counter_call","name":"Dara","text":"Ash may lie to cause my death; countering Right avoids his trap and keeps me alive."}
{"i":535,"type":"whisper","stage":"bridge","round":8,"phase":"counter_call","from":"Dara","to":"Bex","text":"Stay allied; I counter Right now."}
{"i":536,"type":"thought","stage":"bridge","round":8,"phase":"counter_call","name":"Gus","text":"Cole died trusting Ash's Left call; the reveal proved Ash lied. Ash likely lies again on row 8. I counter Right."}
{"i":545,"type":"thought","stage":"bridge","round":8,"phase":"crossing","name":"Dara","text":"Guide likely lying; Gus’s counter suggests right is safe. I must survive to win."}
